        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn IUFBI / IUFBD, Mortise Entryset with Egg Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in both a single cylinder and a dummy function, the Mortise Entryset with Egg Knob is a stunning example of traditional style. Hand forged, it is made using a hammer and anvil so each piece is a unique work of art. It has a black finish that mimics the texture of weathered iron for an old world touch. A mortise lock, it is for 1-3/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/forged-iron-egg-knob-acorn-iuqbd\"><b>Forged Iron Egg Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"2\" border=0\" class=\"text\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Mortise Entryset with Egg Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For exterior and interior use.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy gauge plated steel mortise case.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-friction brass latch bolt.</li>\r\n<li>The deadbolt is made of brass with hardened steel inserts.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Acorn Iron Art Mortise Cylinder Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Height: 9-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Height: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" Standard, Optional up to 3\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Stile Width: Recommend 4-1/2” with a 4-1/4” minimum.</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C-Keyway</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ACO-Mortise-Specifications.gif?v=1704354518\" width=\"255\" height=\"273\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Acorn Mortise Lock Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Handleset:</b> Blank trim for non-working doors that does not have a turnpiece or a cylinder. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> A key operates the deadbolt from the exterior while a thumbturn operates it from the interior. The latch is operated by a knob from both the exterior and the interior. Panic Proof: Turning of inside knob will retract both deadbolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe handing actually refers to the mortise lock, rather than the knob. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Due to the handmade craftsman nature of this product, all dimensions are approximate. DO NOT DRILL ANY HOLES until you have the actual pieces to be mounted.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Mortise Entryset with Egg Knob, Acorn IUFBI / IUFBD",
                "description": "Available in both a single cylinder and a dummy function, the Mortise Entryset with Egg Knob is a stunning example of traditional style. Hand forged, it is made using a hammer and anvil so each piece is a unique work of art. It has a black finish that mimics the texture of weathered iron for an old world touch. A mortise lock, it is for 1-3/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors.\r\n",
